{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-score-transparency","title":"评分透明与构成解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-tier-badge/credit-score-transparency","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"评分透明与构成解释\">评分透明与构成解释</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>透明度是信用分系统能否长期运转的前提。原因不是道德，而是<strong>激励效率</strong>：商家不知道自己为什么掉分，就无法改善；改善不了，信用分就退化成随机惩罚，商家的最优策略从「做好经营」变成「试探规则边界」。</p>\n<p>透明不等于公开全部算法。真正需要向商家解释的是三件事：<strong>哪些维度在影响我</strong>、<strong>每个维度我现在处于什么位置</strong>、<strong>做什么能让它变好</strong>。这与模型可解释性领域的做法一致：SHAP 把每个特征对单次预测的贡献加性分解，让「为什么是这个结果」变成一个逐项列出的清单（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.07874\">Lundberg &amp; Lee, A Unified Approach to Interpreting Model Predictions</a>）。信用分不一定要用 SHAP，但必须提供<strong>同样形态的输出</strong>：一个可加、逐项、与总分自洽的贡献分解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[信用分 B 端展示] --&gt; B1[总分层&lt;br/&gt;分数 + 等级 + 变化]&#10;  A --&gt; B2[维度层&lt;br/&gt;各维度分 + 权重]&#10;  A --&gt; B3[事件层&lt;br/&gt;近期扣分/加分明细]&#10;  A --&gt; B4[行动层&lt;br/&gt;恢复条件与预计影响]&#10;  B1 --&gt; C[商家理解]&#10;  B2 --&gt; C&#10;  B3 --&gt; C&#10;  B4 --&gt; D[行为改变]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[分数改善]&#10;  E --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[信用分 B 端展示] --&gt; B1[总分层&lt;br/&gt;分数 + 等级 + 变化]\n  A --&gt; B2[维度层&lt;br/&gt;各维度分 + 权重]\n  A --&gt; B3[事件层&lt;br/&gt;近期扣分/加分明细]\n  A --&gt; B4[行动层&lt;br/&gt;恢复条件与预计影响]\n  B1 --&gt; C[商家理解]\n  B2 --&gt; C\n  B3 --&gt; C\n  B4 --&gt; D[行为改变]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[分数改善]\n  E --&gt; A</pre><p>四层里最容易缺失的是第四层。前三层回答「发生了什么」，第四层回答「接下来做什么」，只有后者才驱动行为。各层对应的申诉入口见 <a href=\"../penalty-appeal-govern/credit-appeal-correction\">申诉与分数纠正</a>，等级变化如何触发通知见 <a href=\"credit-tier-threshold\">信用等级与阈值</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>透明层次</th>\n<th>面向对象</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>是否可省略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总分层</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>当前分、等级、环比变化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度层</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>五维分数、权重、同品类分位</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件层</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>逐条扣分/加分事件与时间</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行动层</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>恢复条件、预计恢复时间</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则层</td>\n<td>商家（概要）</td>\n<td>规则类别与处置类型</td>\n<td>部分可省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现层</td>\n<td>监管/审计</td>\n<td>具体阈值、算法、数据源</td>\n<td>对内开放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构成解释的数据结构\">构成解释的数据结构</h2><h3 id=\"可加分解是硬约束\">可加分解是硬约束</h3><p>要让商家看懂，分解必须<strong>可加且自洽</strong>：各维度贡献之和等于总分（在允许的舍入误差内）。任何「黑箱修正项」（如「综合调整 −12 分」而不给原因）都会破坏信任，也会让申诉无法定位。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>norm</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext> </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>event</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum_i w_i \\cdot \\text{norm}(x_i) \\cdot \\rho \\ + \\ \\sum_j \\Delta_j^{\\text{event}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">event</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中第一项是维度加权部分，第二项是离散事件调整（惩戒扣分与里程碑加分）。这个结构对应 <a href=\"../credit-model-dimension/credit-dimension-weight\">履约/纠纷/质量/合规维度与权重</a> 的维度设计和 <a href=\"../credit-model-dimension/credit-score-decay-recover\">分数衰减、累积与恢复机制</a> 的事件机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entity_id&quot;: &quot;ent_90231&quot;,&#10;  &quot;score&quot;: 742.0,&#10;  &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;silver&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scheme_version&quot;: &quot;tier-2026-09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;as_of&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27&quot;,&#10;  &quot;components&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;dimension&quot;: &quot;fulfillment&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight&quot;: 0.32,&#10;      &quot;raw_score&quot;: 0.81,&#10;      &quot;contribution&quot;: 259.2,&#10;      &quot;peer_percentile&quot;: 0.44,&#10;      &quot;trend_30d&quot;: -0.03&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;dimension&quot;: &quot;dispute&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight&quot;: 0.23,&#10;      &quot;raw_score&quot;: 0.88,&#10;      &quot;contribution&quot;: 202.4,&#10;      &quot;peer_percentile&quot;: 0.61,&#10;      &quot;trend_30d&quot;: 0.01&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;dimension&quot;: &quot;quality&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight&quot;: 0.18,&#10;      &quot;raw_score&quot;: 0.79,&#10;      &quot;contribution&quot;: 142.2,&#10;      &quot;peer_percentile&quot;: 0.38,&#10;      &quot;trend_30d&quot;: -0.02&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;dimension&quot;: &quot;compliance&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight&quot;: 0.17,&#10;      &quot;raw_score&quot;: 0.95,&#10;      &quot;contribution&quot;: 161.5,&#10;      &quot;peer_percentile&quot;: 0.72,&#10;      &quot;trend_30d&quot;: 0.0&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;dime