an class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dimension\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"raw_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"contribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"peer_percentile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.29</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"trend_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_adjustments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ref_event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88123</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"late_shipment_penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-18.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applied_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"restore_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-02-10\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rounding_residual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个字段值得单独说明。<code>peer_percentile</code> 给出的是<strong>同品类同期的相对位置</strong>，比绝对分更有指导意义——商家看到「履约 0.81 分处于同品类 44 分位」就知道自己其实是落后的，尽管 0.81 看起来不低。<code>rounding_residual</code> 显式暴露舍入误差，避免商家做加法对不上时怀疑数据造假。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解释要细化到事件-而不是停在维度\">解释要细化到事件，而不是停在维度</h3><p>维度层告诉商家「履约在拖后腿」，但商家需要知道是<strong>哪些订单</strong>。事件层必须能下钻：每条扣分记录的订单号、触发规则、判定依据、申诉入口与恢复时间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>是否对商家可见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ref_event_id</code></td>\n<td>事件唯一标识，申诉引用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reason_code</code></td>\n<td>规则编码（非自然语言）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>delta</code></td>\n<td>该事件扣分额</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>applied_at</code></td>\n<td>生效时间</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>restore_at</code></td>\n<td>预期恢复时间</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>evidence_uri</code></td>\n<td>判定证据（订单、物流单）</td>\n<td>是（脱敏后）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rule_internal_id</code></td>\n<td>内部规则版本与阈值</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"解释的边界-什么不能说\">解释的边界：什么不能说</h2><h3 id=\"阈值细节的开放程度\">阈值细节的开放程度</h3><p>完全公开阈值会直接诱发博弈：商家知道「延迟率低于 4% 就不扣分」后，会精确地把延迟率控制在 3.9%，而不去优化真正的配送质量。这与 Goodhart 定律描述的机制一致——「当度量成为目标，它就不再是好的度量」（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodhart%27s_law\">Goodhart&#39;s law</a>）。</p>\n<p>折中做法是<strong>公开阶梯但不公开精确切点</strong>：告诉商家「延迟率 &lt;5% 为优、5%–10% 为良、&gt;10% 为差」，但不公布 4% 与 10% 之间那段连续映射的具体系数。这样商家有明确方向，又无法做边界套利。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信息类别</th>\n<th>建议开放程度</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维度名称与权重</td>\n<td>完全公开</td>\n<td>决定努力方向，无法套利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等级阈值</td>\n<td>完全公开</td>\n<td>已是承诺，必须公开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度评级的档位区间</td>\n<td>公开（粗粒度）</td>\n<td>提供方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度映射的精确函数</td>\n<td>不公开</td>\n<td>防止边界套利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反作弊规则细节</td>\n<td>不公开</td>\n<td>公开即失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型特征清单</td>\n<td>概要公开</td>\n<td>满足知情权，不暴露对抗面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"反欺诈与知情权的张力\">反欺诈与知情权的张力</h3><p>有些规则一旦公开就失效：刷单检测的具体阈值、关联主体识别的信号组合。这类规则应当以<strong>类别</strong>形式公开（「平台会识别异常交易模式」），细节保留在内部。这不违背透明原则，因为商家要知道的是「哪些行为会扣分」，而不是「检测器的阈值是多少」。这个边界在合规语境下也成立：透明义务要求的是提供<strong>有意义的信息</strong>，而非公开全部实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"面向监管与审计的解释\">面向监管与审计的解释</h2><h3 id=\"模型文档化\">模型文档化</h3><p>对监管与内部审计，透明度的要求从「商家能理解」上升为「第三方能复核」。国际实践提供了可直接采用的模板：模型卡（Model Cards）要求记录模型细节、预期用途、评估因素、指标、评估数据、训练数据、分组量化分析、伦理考量与局限（见 <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.03993\">Mitchell et al., Model Cards for Model Reporting</a>）。信用分模型应当有对应的文档，且<strong>分组量化分析</strong>一节在这里尤其重要——它要求给出不同商家规模、不同市场、不同品类下的分数分布，这是发现系统性偏见的唯一途径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不利决定的说明义务\">不利决定的说明义务</h3><p>当信用分导致降档、限流、提高保证金等不利后果时，平台需要给出说明。欧盟 DSA 要求平台在限制商家账户或处罚内容时给出理由，并提供内部投诉处理与庭外争议解决渠道（见 <a href=\"https://digital-strategy.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-services-act-package\">Digital Services Act: 平台义务</a>）。这在结构上与消费者信用领域的<strong>不利行动通知</strong>同源：必须以书面或电子形式告知决定、所依据的信息来源机构、以及异议权利（见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/1681m\">15 U.S.C. § 1681m</a>）。</p>\n<p>因此 B 端展示的构成解释不只是一个 UI 需求，它是<strong>合规工件的上游</strong>：申诉受理时需要的每一条信息，都应当在解释接口里已经存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>透明度的目标是让商家知道「哪些维度影响我、我现在在哪、做什么能变好」，而非公开算法。</li>\n<li>构成分解必须<strong>可加且自洽</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>norm</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i w_i \\cdot \\text{norm}(x_i) + \\sum_j \\Delta_j = S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>），不得存在无原因的黑箱修正项。</li>\n<li>解释要给出 <code>peer_percentile</code>（同品类同期分位），绝对分单独看会误导商家。</li>\n<li>事件层必须能下钻到具体订单与规则编码，<code>ref_event_id</code> 是申诉引用的锚点。</li>\n<li>公开档位区间而不公开精确切点，避免商家做边界套利；反作弊规则只公开类别。</li>\n<li>对监管采用模型卡（Model Cards）格式，其中分组量化分析是发现系统性偏见的唯一途径。</li>\n<li>降档等不利决定需要说明义务，DSA 与不利行动通知制度均要求告知依据与异议路径；B 端解释接口是申诉流程的上游。</li>\n<li>申诉如何回滚分数见 <a href=\"../penalty-appeal-govern/credit-appeal-correction\">申诉与分数纠正</a>，公平性审计见 <a href=\"../penalty-appeal-govern/credit-score-audit-fairness\">评分审计与公平性治理</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评分透明与构成解释","id":"评分透明与构成解释"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构成解释的数据结构","id":"构成解释的数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"可加分解是硬约束","id":"可加分解是硬约束"},{"level":3,"text":"解释要细化到事件，而不是停在维度","id":"解释要细化到事件-而不是停在维度"},{"level":2,"text":"解释的边界：什么不能说","id":"解释的边界-什么不能说"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值细节的开放程度","id":"阈值细节的开放程度"},{"level":3,"text":"反欺诈与知情权的张力","id":"反欺诈与知情权的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"面向监管与审计的解释","id":"面向监管与审计的解释"},{"level":3,"text":"模型文档化","id":"模型文档化"},{"level":3,"text":"不利决定的说明义务","id":"不利决定的说明义务"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信用标识与买家信任展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-tier-badge/merchant-badge-trust-signal"},"next":{"title":"流量/账期/保证金/活动权益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/traffic-payout-term-benefit"}}